<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Taiwan-based underwater photographer documenting marine life through macro and wide-angle photography."
>
  <section class="about-page">
    <article class="about-content">
      <p class="eyebrow">Underwater photographer · Taiwan</p>
      <h1>About</h1>
      <div class="about-copy">
        <p>
          I began scuba diving and underwater photography in 2021, initially drawn
          to the strange and fascinating creatures found in the smallest corners of
          the ocean. Focusing primarily on macro photography, I began learning
          underwater composition and lighting while paying closer attention to
          marine life.
        </p>
        <p>
          A pivotal trip to Romblon in the Philippines inspired me to take my
          photography further and refine my creative approach. While macro
          photography remained at the heart of my work, a visit to Raja Ampat,
          Indonesia, in February 2026 opened a new chapter and expanded my interest
          into wide-angle underwater photography.
        </p>
        <p>
          Today, I photograph both macro and wide-angle subjects, emphasizing clean
          compositions, controlled lighting, and an authentic representation of
          marine life and underwater ecosystems. Through my images, I hope to share
          the extraordinary diversity and beauty of the ocean while remaining true
          to the environments and animals I encounter. I continue to develop my
          craft in the waters around Taiwan—an often overlooked yet remarkable
          diving destination that I am proud to call home.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <aside class="contact-card" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Get in touch</p>
      <h2 id="contact-heading">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For collaborations, licensing, print inquiries, or other opportunities,
        please send me a message on Instagram.
      </p>
      <a
        class="contact-primary"
        href="https://www.instagram.com/7yuny1/"
